      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f42e5a54014a60529c7931e|full_name} but the editor setting is \"Forced On\" on Mobile quality? which is currently inaccurate as it should be Per Texture. this bug report is a request to bring the editor quality settings up to date with the changes made to the client, and I don't understand how the points you've brought up contribute directly to that\n\nI mean I personally think the decision to change to Per Texture was terrible but this is the wrong thread for discussing that, I'm just asking that the editor quality settings be fixed because they're outdated and I think it would do us and the greater vrchat community a great service if we stayed on topic",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
